# katamari-nx-installer (the renut_nx_ultimate_installer page): local tooling and test outputs (game data never belongs here)
# The NRO is a release asset of the katamari-nx repository; the deployment workflow downloads it.
release/*.nro
# made by the tests: made from the game, never committed
release/deko3d_glsl.bin
.claude/
__pycache__/
*.log
node_modules/
wasm/src/*/build/
test/out_*
out/
*.lz4b
*.zip
# Pyodide's standard library: the page loads it (blur-nx-installer de297ce found it never committed: shaders failed)
!vendor/pyodide/python_stdlib.zip
